        "custom_liquid": "{% liquid\n  assign sgx_app_image = product.featured_image\n\n  if product.images.size > 5\n    assign sgx_app_image = product.images[5]\n  elsif product.images.size > 1\n    assign sgx_app_image = product.images[1]\n  endif\n%}\n\n<style>\n/* ==================================================\n   MEARI APP — FORCED DESKTOP AND MOBILE LAYOUT\n   ================================================== */\n\n.shopify-section:has(.sgx-app-section),\n.shopify-section:has(.sgx-app-section) > div,\n.shopify-section:has(.sgx-app-section) .section,\n.shopify-section:has(.sgx-app-section) .section__inner,\n.shopify-section:has(.sgx-app-section) .container,\n.shopify-section:has(.sgx-app-section) .page-width {\n  width: 100% !important;\n  max-width: none !important;\n  min-height: 0 !important;\n  margin: 0 !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n}\n\n.sgx-app-section,\n.sgx-app-section * {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\n.sgx-app-section {\n  --sgx-blue: #43a8ff;\n  --sgx-orange: #ff6a13;\n  --sgx-white: #ffffff;\n  --sgx-muted: #b8c9dc;\n\n  position: relative !important;\n  width: 100% !important;\n  height: auto !important;\n  min-height: 0 !important;\n  margin: 0 !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n  overflow: hidden !important;\n  color: var(--sgx-white);\n  font-family: inherit;\n\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(\n      circle at 77% 25%,\n      rgba(38, 147, 249, 0.25),\n      transparent 35%\n    ),\n    linear-gradient(\n      135deg,\n      #03101f 0%,\n      #071d36 55%,\n      #03111f 100%\n    );\n}\n\n.sgx-app-section::before {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  opacity: 0.07;\n\n  background-image:\n    linear-gradient(\n      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04) 1px,\n      transparent 1px\n    ),\n    linear-gradient(\n      90deg,\n      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04) 1px,\n      transparent 1px\n    );\n\n  background-size: 48px 48px;\n}\n\n/* ==================================================\n   MAIN DESKTOP ROW\n   ================================================== */\n\n.sgx-app-layout {\n  position: relative !important;\n  z-index: 2 !important;\n\n  width: min(1240px, calc(100% - 48px)) !important;\n  height: auto !important;\n  min-height: 0 !important;\n\n  margin: 0 auto !important;\n  padding: 72px 0 90px !important;\n\n  display: flex !important;\n  flex-direction: row !important;\n  flex-wrap: nowrap !important;\n\n  align-items: center !important;\n  justify-content: space-between !important;\n\n  gap: 70px !important;\n}\n\n/* ==================================================\n   LEFT CONTENT\n   ================================================== */\n\n.sgx-app-content {\n  order: 1 !important;\n\n  width: calc(50% - 35px) !important;\n  max-width: 610px !important;\n  min-width: 0 !important;\n\n  margin: 0 !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n\n  position: static !important;\n  transform: none !important;\n  align-self: center !important;\n}\n\n.sgx-app-eyebrow {\n  margin: 0 0 13px !important;\n  color: var(--sgx-orange);\n\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-weight: 850;\n  letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.sgx-app-section h2 {\n  margin: 0 0 20px !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n\n  color: #ffffff;\n\n  font-size: clamp(42px, 4.7vw, 66px);\n  line-height: 1.03;\n  letter-spacing: -0.045em;\n  font-weight: 850;\n}\n\n.sgx-app-section h2 span {\n  display: block;\n  color: var(--sgx-blue);\n}\n\n.sgx-app-description {\n  max-width: 590px;\n  margin: 0 0 28px !important;\n\n  color: var(--sgx-muted);\n\n  font-size: 17px;\n  line-height: 1.65;\n}\n\n/* ==================================================\n   FEATURES\n   ================================================== */\n\n.sgx-app-features {\n  display: grid !important;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)) !important;\n  gap: 13px 18px !important;\n\n  margin: 0 0 30px !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n}\n\n.sgx-app-feature {\n  min-width: 0;\n\n  display: flex !important;\n  align-items: center !important;\n  gap: 10px !important;\n\n  margin: 0 !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n\n  color: #eaf5ff;\n\n  font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\n.sgx-app-feature-icon {\n  width: 36px;\n  height: 36px;\n  flex: 0 0 36px;\n\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n\n  color: var(--sgx-blue);\n\n  border: 1px solid rgba(67, 168, 255, 0.28);\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  background: rgba(22, 134, 232, 0.13);\n}\n\n.sgx-app-feature-icon svg {\n  width: 18px;\n  height: 18px;\n\n  fill: none;\n  stroke: currentColor;\n  stroke-width: 1.8;\n  stroke-linecap: round;\n  stroke-linejoin: round;\n}\n\n/* ==================================================\n   STORE BUTTONS\n   ================================================== */\n\n.sgx-app-stores {\n  display: flex !important;\n  flex-direction: row !important;\n  flex-wrap: wrap !important;\n  gap: 11px !important;\n\n  margin: 0 !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n}\n\n.sgx-app-store {\n  width: auto !important;\n  min-width: 180px !important;\n  min-height: 56px !important;\n\n  margin: 0 !important;\n  padding: 9px 16px !important;\n\n  display: inline-flex !important;\n  align-items: center !important;\n  justify-content: flex-start !important;\n  gap: 10px !important;\n\n  color: #ffffff !important;\n  text-decoration: none !important;\n\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);\n  border-radius: 11px;\n  background: #05080d;\n\n  box-shadow: 0 12px 27px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24);\n}\n\n.sgx-app-store svg {\n  width: 27px;\n  height: 27px;\n  flex: 0 0 27px;\n  fill: currentColor;\n}\n\n.sgx-app-store small {\n  display: block;\n  margin: 0 0 2px;\n\n  color: #d4dce6;\n\n  font-size: 8px;\n  line-height: 1;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.sgx-app-store strong {\n  display: block;\n  color: #ffffff;\n\n  font-size: 15px;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n}\n\n/* ==================================================\n   RIGHT APP DASHBOARD\n   ================================================== */\n\n.sgx-app-visual {\n  order: 2 !important;\n\n  width: calc(50% - 35px) !important;\n  max-width: 570px !important;\n  min-width: 0 !important;\n  height: auto !important;\n  min-height: 0 !important;\n\n  margin: 0 !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n\n  position: static !important;\n  transform: none !important;\n  align-self: center !important;\n}\n\n.sgx-app-dashboard {\n  position: relative !important;\n\n  width: 100% !important;\n  max-width: 570px !important;\n  height: auto !important;\n  min-height: 0 !important;\n\n  margin: 0 auto !important;\n  padding: 12px !important;\n\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.17);\n  border-radius: 27px;\n\n  background:\n    linear-gradient(\n      155deg,\n      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11),\n      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035)\n    );\n\n  box-shadow:\n    0 30px 65px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.38),\n    inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025);\n\n  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n\n  transform: none !important;\n  inset: auto !important;\n}\n\n.sgx-app-screen {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: auto;\n  overflow: hidden;\n\n  border-radius: 19px;\n  background: #07182a;\n}\n\n.sgx-app-screen-header {\n  padding: 17px 18px;\n\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n\n  color: #ffffff;\n\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n}\n\n.sgx-app-online {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 7px;\n\n  color: #bce5ff;\n\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 650;\n}\n\n.sgx-app-online-dot {\n  width: 8px;\n  height: 8px;\n\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: #42d78d;\n\n  box-shadow: 0 0 11px rgba(66, 215, 141, 0.62);\n}\n\n/* ==================================================\n   LIVE IMAGE\n   ================================================== */\n\n.sgx-app-live {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: auto;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #0b1826;\n}\n\n.sgx-app-live-image {\n  display: block;\n\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n\n  object-fit: cover;\n  object-position: center;\n}\n\n.sgx-app-live::after {\n  content: \"LIVE\";\n\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 13px;\n  left: 13px;\n\n  padding: 6px 9px;\n\n  color: #ffffff;\n\n  border-radius: 7px;\n  background: #e84938;\n\n  font-size: 9px;\n  line-height: 1;\n  font-weight: 850;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n}\n\n/* ==================================================\n   APP CONTROLS\n   ================================================== */\n\n.sgx-app-controls {\n  padding: 14px;\n\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n  gap: 9px;\n}\n\n.sgx-app-control {\n  min-width: 0;\n  padding: 12px 7px;\n\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 7px;\n\n  color: #dcecff;\n\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.055);\n\n  font-size: 10px;\n  line-height: 1.3;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.sgx-app-control svg {\n  width: 18px;\n  height: 18px;\n  flex: 0 0 18px;\n\n  fill: none;\n  stroke: var(--sgx-blue);\n  stroke-width: 1.8;\n  stroke-linecap: round;\n  stroke-linejoin: round;\n}\n\n/* ==================================================\n   EVENTS\n   ================================================== */\n\n.sgx-app-events {\n  margin: 0 14px 14px;\n  padding: 13px;\n\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n  gap: 9px;\n\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n  border-radius: 13px;\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n}\n\n.sgx-app-event {\n  min-width: 0;\n\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: 7px;\n\n  color: #c1d0e0;\n\n  font-size: 9px;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\n.sgx-app-event-dot {\n  width: 7px;\n  height: 7px;\n  flex: 0 0 7px;\n  margin-top: 3px;\n\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: var(--sgx-blue);\n\n  box-shadow: 0 0 9px rgba(67, 168, 255, 0.55);\n}\n\n/* ==================================================\n   TABLET\n   ================================================== */\n\n@media screen and (max-width: 980px) {\n  .sgx-app-layout {\n    width: min(100% - 36px, 760px) !important;\n    padding: 64px 0 90px !important;\n\n    flex-direction: column !important;\n    align-items: stretch !important;\n\n    gap: 44px !important;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-content,\n  .sgx-app-visual {\n    width: 100% !important;\n    max-width: 700px !important;\n\n    margin-left: auto !important;\n    margin-right: auto !important;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-content {\n    text-align: center !important;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-description {\n    margin-left: auto !important;\n    margin-right: auto !important;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-features {\n    max-width: 640px;\n    margin-left: auto !important;\n    margin-right: auto !important;\n\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-stores {\n    justify-content: center !important;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-dashboard {\n    max-width: 570px !important;\n  }\n}\n\n/* ==================================================\n   MOBILE\n   ================================================== */\n\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px) {\n  .sgx-app-layout {\n    width: calc(100% - 26px) !important;\n    padding: 46px 0 110px !important;\n    gap: 34px !important;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-eyebrow {\n    margin-bottom: 10px !important;\n    font-size: 11px;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-section h2 {\n    margin-bottom: 16px !important;\n\n    font-size: clamp(33px, 10vw, 41px);\n    line-height: 1.06;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-description {\n    margin-bottom: 24px !important;\n\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.58;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-features {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;\n    gap: 11px !important;\n\n    margin-bottom: 25px !important;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-feature {\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-feature-icon {\n    width: 39px;\n    height: 39px;\n    flex-basis: 39px;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-stores {\n    display: grid !important;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr !important;\n    gap: 8px !important;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-store {\n    width: 100% !important;\n    min-width: 0 !important;\n    min-height: 52px !important;\n\n    padding: 8px !important;\n    justify-content: center !important;\n    gap: 7px !important;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-store svg {\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n    flex-basis: 22px;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-store small {\n    font-size: 7px;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-store strong {\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-dashboard {\n    width: 100% !important;\n    padding: 8px !important;\n\n    border-radius: 21px;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-screen {\n    border-radius: 15px;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-screen-header {\n    padding: 14px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-online {\n    font-size: 9px;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-live {\n    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-live::after {\n    top: 9px;\n    left: 9px;\n\n    padding: 5px 7px;\n    font-size: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-controls {\n    padding: 10px;\n    gap: 7px;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-control {\n    padding: 10px 4px;\n\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 5px;\n\n    font-size: 9px;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-events {\n    margin: 0 10px 10px;\n    padding: 11px;\n\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    gap: 7px;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-event {\n    font-size: 9px;\n  }\n}\n\n@media screen and (max-width: 390px) {\n  .sgx-app-layout {\n    width: calc(100% - 20px) !important;\n  }\n\n  .sgx-app-stores {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;\n  }\n}\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"sgx-app-section\">\n  <div class=\"sgx-app-layout\">\n\n    <div class=\"sgx-app-content\">\n\n      <div class=\"sgx-app-eyebrow\">\n        De MEARI-app\n      </div>\n\n      <h2>\n        Altijd en overal\n        <span>verbonden.</span>\n      </h2>\n\n      <p class=\"sgx-app-description\">\n        Bekijk livebeelden, ontvang slimme meldingen en beheer uw camera\n        eenvoudig via de MEARI-app. Zo houdt u altijd controle over uw\n        woning, tuin of oprit.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"sgx-app-features\">\n\n        <div class=\"sgx-app-feature\">\n          <div class=\"sgx-app-feature-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <path d=\"M3 6h18v12H3z\"></path>\n              <path d=\"m9 10 6 2-6 2v-4Z\"></path>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          Livebeelden bekijken\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"sgx-app-feature\">\n          <div class=\"sgx-app-feature-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <path d=\"M18 8a6 6 0 1 0-12 0c0 7-3 7-3 9h18c0-2-3-2-3-9\"></path>\n              <path d=\"M10 21h4\"></path>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          Slimme meldingen ontvangen\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"sgx-app-feature\">\n          <div class=\"sgx-app-feature-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <rect x=\"9\" y=\"3\" width=\"6\" height=\"11\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n              <path d=\"M5 10a7 7 0 0 0 14 0M12 17v4M9 21h6\"></path>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          Terugspreken via de camera\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"sgx-app-feature\">\n          <div class=\"sgx-app-feature-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <path d=\"M4 12a8 8 0 1 0 2.3-5.7\"></path>\n              <path d=\"M4 5v5h5\"></path>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          Opnames terugkijken\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"sgx-app-feature\">\n          <div class=\"sgx-app-feature-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <path d=\"M12 3v18M3 12h18\"></path>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          Instellingen beheren\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"sgx-app-feature\">\n          <div class=\"sgx-app-feature-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <path d=\"M8 12h8M12 8v8\"></path>\n              <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          Delen met het gezin\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"sgx-app-stores\">\n\n        <a\n          href=\"#\"\n          class=\"sgx-app-store\"\n          aria-label=\"Download de MEARI-app in de App Store\"\n        >\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <path d=\"M16.8 12.8c0-2 1.6-3 1.7-3.1-1-1.5-2.6-1.7-3.1-1.7-1.3-.1-2.6.8-3.3.8-.7 0-1.8-.8-3-.8-1.5 0-3 .9-3.8 2.3-1.7 2.9-.4 7.2 1.2 9.5.8 1.1 1.7 2.4 2.9 2.3 1.2 0 1.6-.7 3.1-.7 1.4 0 1.9.7 3.1.7 1.3 0 2.1-1.1 2.8-2.2.9-1.3 1.3-2.6 1.3-2.7-.1 0-2.9-1.1-2.9-4.4Z\"></path>\n            <path d=\"M14.6 6.6c.6-.8 1.1-1.9 1-3-.9 0-2 .6-2.7 1.4-.6.7-1.1 1.8-1 2.9 1 .1 2-.5 2.7-1.3Z\"></path>\n          </svg>\n\n          <div>\n            <small>Download in de</small>\n            <strong>App Store</strong>\n          </div>\n        </a>\n\n        <a\n          href=\"#\"\n          class=\"sgx-app-store\"\n          aria-label=\"Download de MEARI-app via Google Play\"\n        >\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <path d=\"M3 2.5v19l10-9.5L3 2.5Z\"></path>\n            <path d=\"m14 11 3-2-10-6 7 8Z\"></path>\n            <path d=\"m14 13 3 2-10 6 7-8Z\"></path>\n            <path d=\"m18 9 3 1.8c.9.5.9 1.8 0 2.4L18 15l-4-3 4-3Z\"></path>\n          </svg>\n\n          <div>\n            <small>Ontdek het op</small>\n            <strong>Google Play</strong>\n          </div>\n        </a>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"sgx-app-visual\">\n\n      <div class=\"sgx-app-dashboard\">\n        <div class=\"sgx-app-screen\">\n\n          <div class=\"sgx-app-screen-header\">\n            <span>MEARI N2</span>\n\n            <span class=\"sgx-app-online\">\n              <span class=\"sgx-app-online-dot\"></span>\n              Online\n            </span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"sgx-app-live\">\n            {% if sgx_app_image %}\n              {{\n                sgx_app_image\n                | image_url: width: 1100\n                | image_tag:\n                  class: 'sgx-app-live-image',\n                  loading: 'lazy',\n                  widths: '420, 620, 820, 1100',\n                  sizes: '(max-width: 600px) 92vw, 570px',\n                  alt: 'Livebeeld van de MEARI N2-camera'\n              }}\n            {% endif %}\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"sgx-app-controls\">\n\n            <div class=\"sgx-app-control\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                <path d=\"M8 5h8v14H8z\"></path>\n                <path d=\"M4 9h4m8 0h4\"></path>\n              </svg>\n              PTZ-bediening\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"sgx-app-control\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"7\"></circle>\n                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle>\n              </svg>\n              Opnemen\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"sgx-app-control\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                <rect x=\"9\" y=\"3\" width=\"6\" height=\"11\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n                <path d=\"M5 10a7 7 0 0 0 14 0\"></path>\n              </svg>\n              Terugspreken\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"sgx-app-events\">\n\n            <div class=\"sgx-app-event\">\n              <span class=\"sgx-app-event-dot\"></span>\n              Persoon gedetecteerd bij de entree · 12:42\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"sgx-app-event\">\n              <span class=\"sgx-app-event-dot\"></span>\n              Beweging waargenomen bij de oprit · 10:18\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"sgx-app-event\">\n              <span class=\"sgx-app-event-dot\"></span>\n              Livebeeld bekeken · 08:31\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>",
        "section_height": "default",
